  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Irak Humanitarian Action Plan (IHAP) och Regional Response Plan for Iraqi Refugees (RRP) f&#xf6;r UNICEF. I Irak tillg&#xe5;ng till bas service s&#xe5;som h&#xe4;lsa, nutrition, vatten/sanitet. Risk f&#xf6;r  v&#xe5;ld/f&#xf6;rtryck. Regionalt- Syrien och Jordanien fr&#xe4;mst h&#xe4;lsa, nutrition, utbildning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Iraq Humanitarian Action Plan (IHAP) and Regional Response Plan for Iraqi Refugees(RRP). In Iraq access to basic servic for children health,nutrition,water/sanitation. Risk abuse/exploit. Support to Iraqi refugees in the Region, including support in Syria for access to health and nutrition services, education for children in emergencies. In Jordan education and child protection.</narrative>
  </description>
